    "samplingMethod": "Official English Midi colour-palette PDF page 1 rendered with Poppler pdftoppm at 300 dpi. For each imaged bead swatch, sample the interior rectangle x = code-left + 2..39 pt and y = code-baseline + 12..38 pt, then take the channel-wise median of rendered pixels and round to 8-bit RGB. This avoids the label, border, and most specular highlights. Values are approximate photo-derived reference colours, not official RGB standards.",
